WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.819
Hello, friend.

00:00:00.819 --> 00:00:02.456
Look at your remote.

00:00:02.456 --> 00:00:05.730
Seven buttons would be overkill for this part.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.367
We only need one.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:13.097
Let's get TT tv onto your Fire TV Stick or Cube running Fire OS.

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:14.384
Open Settings.

00:00:14.384 --> 00:00:15.836
My Fire TV.

00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:16.319
About.

00:00:16.319 --> 00:00:19.222
Highlight the name of your device.

00:00:19.222 --> 00:00:22.125
Press the centre button seven times.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.576
Now press Back.

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:25.027
See Developer Options?

00:00:25.027 --> 00:00:27.930
It was there the whole time.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.211
Go Home.

00:00:29.211 --> 00:00:31.133
Open Find, then Search.

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.093
Type Downloader.

00:00:32.093 --> 00:00:37.378
Look for the orange app by A F T V news.

00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:39.300
Choose Get, or Download.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.222
Give it a moment.

00:00:41.542 --> 00:00:45.156
Back in Developer Options, open Install Unknown Apps.

00:00:45.156 --> 00:00:46.512
Turn on Downloader.

00:00:46.512 --> 00:00:50.578
Older Fire TVs call this Apps from Unknown Sources.

00:00:50.578 --> 00:00:53.289
Leave A D B debugging off.

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:55.097
One permission is enough.

00:00:55.417 --> 00:00:56.290
Open Downloader.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:01:00.656
On Home, enter six, nine, five, two, seven, three, five.

00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:02.839
Check the digits on screen.

00:01:02.839 --> 00:01:03.712
Press Go.

00:01:03.712 --> 00:01:06.769
Put the remote down for a second.

00:01:06.769 --> 00:01:09.388
The file is on its way.

00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:12.006
Read the name on your installer.

00:01:12.006 --> 00:01:13.920
It should say TT tv.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.452
Choose Install, then Open.

00:01:15.452 --> 00:01:17.750
Remember the permission you switched on?

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:20.430
You can switch it off again now.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.322
Speak to your provider about login.

00:01:23.322 --> 00:01:26.751
In TT tv, open Settings, then TV service.

00:01:26.751 --> 00:01:29.322
Enter the details they gave you.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:33.180
For movies and box sets, choose their Xtream login.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.931
Back on Home, open TV Guide.

00:01:35.931 --> 00:01:40.389
Use the arrows to find something you actually want to watch.

00:01:40.389 --> 00:01:41.200
Press Select.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.226
That's the good part, friend.

00:01:43.226 --> 00:01:44.847
The remote is yours.

